#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:5
#: 320ab106a967458fa713a847099c70ce
msgid "Dead Reckoning Failsafe"
msgstr "航位推算失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:7
#: f002e67c4c2842a29c5562e101901895
msgid ""
"Copter includes the Dead Reckoning Failsafe that allows a vehicle to return "
"home (or partially return home) if it loses GPS (or more accurately if it "
"loses its position estimate which could be based on GPS, OpticalFlow, etc)."
msgstr ""
"Copter 包含航位推算失控保护功能，允许飞行器在失去 GPS（或更准确地说是失去位置估计，该估计可能基于 GPS、光流等）时返回 "
"Home（或部分返回 Home）。"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:11
#: f61fb3446b6a481eaef0d3ad2340516a
msgid "This failsafe is available in Copter-4.3 (and higher)"
msgstr "此失控保护在 Copter-4.3（及更高版本）中可用"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:15
#: 4753d4ba98104137ae6eb5ca588ffb6c
msgid ""
"Similar functionality is available using the `copter-deadreckon-home.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"deadreckon-home.lua>`__ script (`video1 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KKShYheW4J0>`__, `video2 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=esM0EqMH_BE>`__)"
msgstr ""
"类似功能可通过 `copter-deadreckon-home.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"deadreckon-home.lua>`__ 脚本实现（`视频1 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KKShYheW4J0>`__，`视频2 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=esM0EqMH_BE>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:18
#: 365e92f748014001bd6e563f1fb68ed4
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:20
#: 1413b3e0e9f34e8681e90e7dbe56027e
msgid ""
"Setup :ref:`wind speed estimation <airspeed-estimation>` including setting "
"the :ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X>`, :ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y "
"<EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y>` and :ref:`EK3_DRAG_MCOEF <EK3_DRAG_MCOEF>` parameters"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`风速估计 <airspeed-estimation>`，包括设置 :ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X "
"<EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_X>`、:ref:`EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y <EK3_DRAG_BCOEF_Y>` 和 "
":ref:`EK3_DRAG_MCOEF <EK3_DRAG_MCOEF>` 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:21
#: 336bd433579647f9a9f219d74f84aecc
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FS_DR_ENABLE <FS_DR_ENABLE>` to \"2\" (RTL) or one of the other "
"available options"
msgstr "将 :ref:`FS_DR_ENABLE <FS_DR_ENABLE>` 设置为\"2\"（RTL）或其他可用选项之一"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:22
#: a30fc02d6af149c8aec57bd853693f6f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT <FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` to the number of seconds that the "
"vehicle can maintain control after losing GPS.  On most vehicles this is "
"only 10 to 30 seconds"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT <FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` 设置为飞行器在失去 GPS 后能够保持控制的秒数。大多数飞行器仅为 10 "
"到 30 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:25
#: 3d9769a6352f466bb3666425036e89b9
msgid "When will it trigger?"
msgstr "何时会触发？"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:27
#: 81dc7283ceff4769958cf75e2bc20a74
msgid ""
"The deadreckoning failsafe will trigger under the same conditions as the "
":ref:`EKF failsafe <ekf-inav-failsafe>`.  Namely when any two of the EKF "
"\"variances\" for compass, position or velocity are higher than the "
":ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` parameter for 1 second.  In practice it"
" is expected that normally it will be the loss of GPS that will trigger the "
"failsafe."
msgstr ""
"航位推算失控保护将在与 :ref:`EKF 失控保护 <ekf-inav-failsafe>` 相同的条件下触发。即当罗盘、位置或速度的任意两个 EKF"
" \"方差\"超过 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 参数持续 1 秒时。实际上，通常预期是 GPS "
"丢失触发此失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:30
#: 49ccb8560016421b80a3f5851c2d85d3
msgid "What will happen when the failsafe triggers?"
msgstr "失控保护触发后会发生什么？"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:32
#: aa68a15cfdcb4f27855286da5f8229b2
msgid ""
"The vehicle will continue to fly normally for 7 to 10 seconds after the loss"
" of GPS"
msgstr "GPS 丢失后，飞行器将继续正常飞行 7 到 10 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:33
#: a476b5eb577c4e58b91134a6e059d089
msgid ""
"\"Dead Reckoning started\" will be displayed on the GCS and the vehicle will"
" switch to :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` mode and begin flying home"
msgstr ""
"地面站将显示\"Dead Reckoning started\"，飞行器将切换至 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 模式并开始飞回 Home"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:34
#: af8d008115ec43388cf7aeeaa9afad78
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does not reach home within :ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT "
"<FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` seconds, the :ref:`EKF failsafe <ekf-inav-failsafe>` will "
"trigger and the vehicle will switch to :ref:`Land <land-mode>` mode"
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器未在 :ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT <FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` 秒内到达 Home，:ref:`EKF 失控保护 <ekf-"
"inav-failsafe>` 将触发，飞行器将切换至 :ref:`Land <land-mode>` 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:35
#: ca031b0e52de4e70a3845822a79c784b
msgid ""
"Even if the GPS recovers while the vehicle is returning home, the vehicle "
"will remain in RTL"
msgstr "即使 GPS 在飞行器返回途中恢复，飞行器仍将保持在 RTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:38
#: c98f8a62b6dc4307bcc048d9d0cac723
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:40
#: 418783b6fa3b48bfa78746e7b85aeec3
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions below to test in the simulator or on a real vehicle."
"  If testing on a real vehicle be ready to re-take control in a manul mode "
"(e.g. :ref:`Stabilize <stabilize-mode>` or :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>`)"
msgstr ""
"按照以下说明在模拟器或真实飞行器上进行测试。如果在真实飞行器上测试，请准备好在手动模式下重新接管控制（例如 :ref:`Stabilize "
"<stabilize-mode>` 或 :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:42
#: c6e1e6e768284ee3a94369c87880c1ec
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` to 65 to allow disabling the GPS from an "
":ref:`auxiliary switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` (any RC input channel "
"may be used)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` 设置为 65，以允许通过 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` 禁用 GPS（可使用任意 RC 输入通道）"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:43
#: bfce9164a31d40fcaa975e28d2de40a5
msgid ""
"Arm and fly the vehicle in any mode that requires GPS (e.g. :ref:`Loiter "
"<loiter-mode>`, :ref:`Guided <ac2_guidedmode>`, :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`, "
"etc)"
msgstr ""
"在任何需要 GPS 的模式下解锁并飞行（例如 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`、:ref:`Guided "
"<ac2_guidedmode>`、:ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 等）"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:44
#: ee245d20cad049bb90ccbbff467bdb4d
msgid ""
"Ensure the EKF has calculated a wind speed estimate by checking “wind_dir” "
"and/or “wind_vel” in the ground station (see \"Viewing Windspeed and "
"Direction in Real-Time\" on :ref:`this page <airspeed-estimation>`)"
msgstr ""
"通过在地面站检查\"wind_dir\"和/或\"wind_vel\"来确认 EKF 已计算出风速估计（请参见 :ref:`此页面 <airspeed-"
"estimation>` 上的\"实时查看风速和风向\"）"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:45
#: 221a3e63f68b46449bdcf42bcfc6cefb
msgid "Raise the auxiliary switch high to disable the GPS"
msgstr "将辅助开关拨高以禁用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:46
#: 7d7309120cac4afd98c88de9c5079b68
msgid ""
"Within 7 to 10 seconds \"Dead Reckoning started\" should be displayed on the"
" GCS and the vehicle should switch to :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` mode and begin "
"flying home"
msgstr ""
"7 到 10 秒内，地面站应显示\"Dead Reckoning started\"，飞行器应切换至 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` "
"模式并开始飞回 Home"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:47
#: 1683d21878a64bad8d593341b0bed6ba
msgid ""
"After :ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT <FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` seconds the :ref:`EKF failsafe "
"<ekf-inav-failsafe>` will trigger and the vehicle will switch to :ref:`Land "
"mode <land-mode>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT <FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` 秒后，:ref:`EKF 失控保护 <ekf-inav-failsafe>` "
"将触发，飞行器将切换至 :ref:`Land 模式 <land-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:48
#: 4ed74d760b39458b85ecc868b5a4a9e4
msgid ""
"If the vehicle's position drifts too much, switch to :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode>` mode to recover control of the vehicle"
msgstr "如果飞行器位置漂移过大，切换至 :ref:`AltHold <altholdmode>` 模式以恢复对飞行器的控制"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:49
#: a474763c1a864fbf8a5d2fc812e319d0
msgid "Lower the auxiliary switch at any time to re-enable the GPS"
msgstr "随时将辅助开关拨低以重新启用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:50
#: d3e2def2795c4c32825b4fd645bd5b7f
msgid ""
"Post testing, lower or raise the :ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT <FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` "
"parameter to reflect the maximum number of seconds the vehicle can maintain "
"control without GPS"
msgstr ""
"测试结束后，根据飞行器在无 GPS 情况下能够保持控制的最大秒数，调低或调高 :ref:`FS_DR_TIMEOUT <FS_DR_TIMEOUT>` "
"参数"

#: ../../source/docs/deadreckoning-failsafe.rst:53
#: 72faed04ea83432294e7d33aca4b8cf3
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"
